{"id":"hq-2cb8","title":"Clear mayor/deacon mail backlog","description":"Mayor inbox currently holds 14 system alerts (see `gt mail inbox mayor/`). Each alert came from `deacon/` or `witness` roles and is blocking new work until the following issues have a plan or resolution:\n- Dog add warning: alpha bead not created (mm-nc8l)\n- Zombie scan: 4 candidate processes (mm-6q2i)\n- Crew remains idle/dirty (mm-uof5)\n- Crew idle mbp_m1/default is dirty (mm-pj2g)\n- mol-session-gc still fails; mail delete loop (hq-jd1y)\n- mol-session-gc formula invalid (hq-84e6)\n- Dog pool stuck; no clear/warrant commands (hq-07ck)\n- Zombie scan results (no warrants) (hq-xltv)\n- RECOVERY_NEEDED mbp_m1/brahmin: stashes present (hq-0k2o)\n- RECOVERY_NEEDED mbp_m1/brahmin (hq-eqvb)\n- [HIGH] Hook empty but work slung: hq-mnfz (hq-mnfz)\n- Stuck dog alpha (no warrant cmd) (mm-ibym)\n- Orphan scan dispatch failed (mm-cmj5)\n- Stuck dog alpha (working w/ empty work) (mm-oxo6)\n\nPlease treat this as the current mayor/deacon blocker queue before moving on to Kafka/DSM/skill work.\n","notes":"Logs show repeated connection errors / TimeoutNegativeWarning for kafka-dsm producer and consumer, so they still exit immediately even though launchctl kickstart -k gui/501/… was run. Datadog kafka_consumer check is healthy, so we need to repair broker connectivity or topic offsets before beads flow.","status":"open","priority":0,"issue_type":"task","owner":"ryan@ryanmaclean.com","created_at":"2026-02-01T16:05:07.675468-08:00","created_by":"mayor","updated_at":"2026-02-01T16:26:29.226332-08:00","labels":["blocking","deacon","mayor"]}
