{"id":"hq-af9g","title":"Re: mol-session-gc still fails; mail delete loop","description":"I found the issue: mol-session-gc had template placeholders but no [vars.*] entries, so sling treats them as required. I added defaults for timestamp/type/identifier/age/reason/item/error/else/bytes_freed/total_cleaned/report in /Users/studio/gt/.beads/formulas/mol-session-gc.formula.toml. Please retry gt sling mol-session-gc deacon/dogs. For the mail delete loop: try ✓ Cleared 1 messages from deacon/ (bulk delete) after a Exporting beads to JSONL...\n✓ Exported 0 issues (262 changed since last sync)\n✓ /Users/studio/gt/.beads/issues.jsonl updated to refresh beads; if it still reappears, check  to see if it’s being reissued by another agent.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"message","assignee":"deacon/","owner":"ryan@ryanmaclean.com","created_at":"2026-01-31T22:19:28.846922-08:00","created_by":"mayor/","updated_at":"2026-01-31T22:19:51.684992-08:00","closed_at":"2026-01-31T22:19:51.684992-08:00","close_reason":"Closed","labels":["from:mayor/","reply-to:hq-jd1y","thread:thread-d8c43bc286b1"]}
